</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfb80294-793e-11f1-a879-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/JCG-Takuy%C5%8D-HL-02.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/bfb80294-793e-11f1-a879-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/JCG-Takuy%C5%8D-HL-02.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">90a6d83a-793a-11f1-a837-836db58cffca</guid><pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 13:30:03 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>东京特约记者 楚良一</dc:creator></item><item><category>亚洲</category><title>越南最南端建跨海大桥 押注40亿美元基建扩大航运、制衡中柬</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%BA%9A%E6%B4%B2/20260706-%E8%B6%8A%E5%8D%97%E6%9C%80%E5%8D%97%E7%AB%AF%E5%BB%BA%E8%B7%A8%E6%B5%B7%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5-%E6%8A%BC%E6%B3%A840%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E5%9F%BA%E5%BB%BA%E6%89%A9%E5%A4%A7%E8%88%AA%E8%BF%90-%E5%88%B6%E8%A1%A1%E4%B8%AD%E6%9F%AC</link><description>
